<text x="80" y="604" width="240" height="84" font-size="15" font-weight="400" color="#1F2A44" text-align="left" line-height="1.4">Ứng dụng desktop cho macOS, Windows, Linux: gom terminal, worktree, diff, GitHub và Linear.</text>
